<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2CO" style="id">- Mbunga Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">2Wakolintu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Lihamba lya ivili lya Paulo kwa Wakolintu</para>
  <para style="toc2">2Wakolintu</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Wak</para>
  <para style="mt2">Lihamba lya ivili kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Wakolintu</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongulelu</para>
  <para style="ip">Kihitabu kya Wakolintu wa ivili kiyandikilwi na mndumindumi Paulo paghati gha lichuva lya 55 na 56. Badili gha kuwelekwa Kilisito sula gha 1:1. Hali ni lihamba lya ivili paghati gha ivili tuwela nazu. Paulo awayandikilili lipinga lya wandu wamkwinila Kilisito lya haku Kolintu. Wasomi wangukwinila yiwa Paulo ayandikili milando mikalipa kulihamba lighangi pambila gha hali kwa wandu wa Kolintu. Haku kuhyetu tuwelili ng'ogha na mahamba hagha Paulo anguyalongelela ku Wakolintu sula gha 2:3-4. Lihamba hali lya ivili ayandikili lipindi akiwela ku Makidonia. Wakolintu sula gha 2:13.</para>
  <para style="ip">Wakolintu wa ivili ni lihamba awelili kayandika kwa hisia na liwelili na ujumbi weni kulola ngalilu gha lipinga lya wandu wenikumkwinila Kilisito haku Kolintu. Paulo angulongelela luheku ghaki kwa milando maheli apokelili kuhuma kwa Titusi. Kulihamba hali tungulivula kwa utali mavulo gha kupegha handa iyandikilwi kulilaghano lihyonu. Paulo angupegha malaghilo gha kukungula mapesa ili kuwatanga watumikila wa haku Yelusalemu Sula gha 8-9. Inguwoneka yiwa amonga gha wandumindumi weni kuvula uhwangi waghangi kuhuma panji gha mapinga gha wandu wamkwinila Kilisito watumili wandu mghati gha lipinga lya wandu wamkwila kilisito wala wenikuwela wahakata wa Paulo ili kuwayinula weni. Wawelili wangulongela yiwa wangukwinila ng'ogha ulongosi wa Paulo, hali ndiwa lukani limgholile ahighilisi kwa makakala ulongosi ghaki handa mndumindumi wa Kilisito, hagha yanguwoneka kumwihu wa kihitabu kya Wakolintu wa ivili.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gha Mghati:</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo angutumbula lihamba ghaki kwa kuwajambusa lipinga lya wandu wamkwinila Kilisito wa haku Kolintu Sula gha 1:1-7</para>
  <para style="io">Mghalu mghangi Paulo angulongela kunani gha kughalambuka kwa mwanja ghaki na hilahila ujumbi aupokelili kuhuma kwa lipinga lya wenikumkwinila Kilisito haku Kolintu na vila wayanga lila lihamba lyaki lya mtumbulo Sula gha 1:8-7:16</para>
  <para style="io">Kangi Paulo angupegha malaghilo kunani gha kukungula mapesa kwaikiva gha kuwatanga wakwinila wa Kilisito haku Yelusalemu sula gha 8:1-9:15</para>
  <para style="io">Kumwihu, Paulo angutetela undumindumi ghaki na angupegha malaghilo kunani gha kuhuya kangi Kolintu sula gha 10:1-13:10</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CO 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 1:1" />Lihamba hali linguhuma kwa nenga Paulo, mwenikugholwa kuwela mndumindumi wa Yesu Kilisito kwa mapalo gha Sapanga nikiva baha pamonga na mlongo Timoseo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 1:1">Tunguwayandikila lihamba hali lipinga lya wandu wenikumkwinila Sapanga wa haku Kolintu, pamonga na wandu wa Sapanga wogha wenikuwela haku Akaya hyogha.<verse eid="2CO 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 1:2" />Sapanga Tati wa twenga na Bambu wa twenga Yesu Kilisito awapeghi umaha ghaki na kuponga.<verse eid="2CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo angumshukwile Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 1:3" />Tumyinuli Sapanga, mwenikuwela Tati wa Bambu wa twenga Yesu Kilisito, Tati mweni kuwawonela luhungu wandu na Sapanga wa kutanga kulipindi lya lung'ai. <verse eid="2CO 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 1:4" />Mweni kututanga lipindi lyogha patuwela na lung'ai ili waghangi pawakolwa na lung'ai, tuwesi kuwatanga handa Sapanga vila angututanga twenga. <verse eid="2CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 1:5" />Kilisito mweni akolilwi na mahakili matangala, na Sapanga akampegha moyu. Hilahila twenga handa watumikila wa Kilisito, tungupokela mahakilo matangala na Sapanga angutupegha moyu. <verse eid="2CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 1:6" />Pamonga na yiwa tunguhakilika kwaikiva gha kuwatanga mwenga na ulokola wa mwenga. <verse eid="2CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 1:7" />Litumaini lya twenga kwa mwenga linguyumbila ng'ogha, kwaikiva tumanya yiwa pamghasika handa twenga ndiwa mngutangwa kulungai halu handa Sapanga atutangile twenga.<verse eid="2CO 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 1:8" />Walongo, tungupala mmanyi ghala mahakilo yatukolile patuwelile haku kumlima wa Asia. Mahakilo hagha yawelili matopa. Twenga twaweni tuwesili ng'ogha kufumilila, hata tukaliwachila yiwa tungaliwesa kuhova. <verse eid="2CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 1:9" />Kangi twenga twaweni tuliwachilile yiwa kihu kya pabehi na twenga, ila hali likatughola tuleki kulikwinila twaweni na kutumbula kumkwinila Sapanga, mweni kuwahindula wala wenikuhova. <verse eid="2CO 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 1:10" />Sapanga atulokolile pala patuwelile pabehi na kuhova, na anguyendelela kutulokola, na twenga tumvikila litumaini yiwa atetulokola. <verse eid="2CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 1:11" />Hinu mwenga vila mnguyendelela kututanga kwa kutuyupila, Sapanga ateyanga mayupo gha wandu watangala weni kutuyupila na atetuhighila, Na wandu watangala watemshukwile Sapanga kwaikiva gha umaha ghaki kwa twenga.<verse eid="2CO 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo angulongelela kwa kyani kayenda ng'ogha ku Kolintu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 1:12" />Hali ndiwa tungulidumbila, na ninguwesa kulonga paluagha yiwa tulamili kwa umaha na uchakaka hula atuhighilile Sapanga, tugholile ng'ogha nagha kwa luhala lwa twenga twaweni ila kwa kutangwa na Sapanga. <verse eid="2CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 1:13" />Tunguwayandikila mwenga mighalu munguwesa kuisoma na kumanya ingulongela niki. Ninguliwachila yiwa mtemanya nesu yiwa ingumaanisa niki. <verse eid="2CO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 1:14" />Ndiwa lichuwa lila paatehika Bambu mtelidumbila twenga handa twenga vila tungulidumbila mwenga.<verse eid="2CO 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 1:15" />Kwaikiva niwelile na litumaini lya kuhika kwa mwenga, nivikili huti lukani lwa kuhika kwa mwenga. Ili mpati kulinoma kwa kuhika mihanja miivili. <verse eid="2CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 1:16" />Nivikile lukani lwa kuwatyangila paniwela mmwanja kuyenda kumlima wa Makedonia na kuhuya kangi kwa mwenga panihuma ku Makedonia, ili mnitangi kumwanja wa kuyenda kumlima wa Yudasia. <verse eid="2CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 1:17" />Mnguwesa kungonya kwa kyani nikaghalambula lukani lwangu. Ghuli, mnguliwachila neka kuliwachila huti kya kughola? Ghuli, mnguwachila ningulongoswa na mawachilo ghangu mweni handa wandu wa kumlima wogha weni kulonga “Ndiwa” na “Ng'ogha” bahala. <verse eid="2CO 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 1:18" />Sapanga kamchakaka hinu kila tuwalongelile mwenga kya ng'ogha “Ndiwa” au “Ng'ogha” bahala. <verse eid="2CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 1:19" />Kwa nagha Kilisito Yesu, Mwana wa Sapanga, yula nenga na Siliwano na Timoseo, tumtangasili kwa mwenga, kawela ng'ogha mundu wa “Ndiwa” na “Ng'ogha” bahala ila mweni machuwa hyogha ni “Ndiwa.” <verse eid="2CO 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 1:20" />Kwa nagha ghala hyogha ayalongile Sapanga yawela “Ndiwa” kwa njila gha Kilisito, na hai ndiwa kwaikiva tungulonga “Hina” ku Kilisito kwa kumuyinula Sapanga. <verse eid="2CO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 1:21" />Hinu hayu mweni kutugangamalisa twenga, pamonga na mwenga ku Kilisito na kutuhaghula ni Sapanga. <verse eid="2CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 1:22" />Hayu kavika Mpumulo ghaki kumioyu gha twenga iweli uhighilisu kwa hyogha ghala atuvikilile kulangiha yiwa twenga ni hindu ghaki.<verse eid="2CO 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 1:23" />Nihika ng'ogha kangi haku kumlima wa Kolintu kwaikiva nipalile ng'ogha kuwakalipila kwa ghala mgholile, hagha ningulongela uchakaka hata Sapanga angumanya. <verse eid="2CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 1:24" />Tungupala ng'ogha kuwalasimisa mwenga mkwinili niki. Kwaikiva tungukwinila mwenga mgholoka maha kuukwinila. Hinu lukani lwa twenga tungupala tugholi mahengu pamonga na mwenga kwaikiva gha luheku lwa mwenga.<verse eid="2CO 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CO 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 2:1" />Hinu nilamula nikotoho kuwatyangila kangi nikawaghola mnyengemali. <verse eid="2CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 2:2" />Kwaikiva paniwanyengemalisa mwenga, ni ghani atenighola nihekeleli? Ni wala wala niwanyengemasili! <verse eid="2CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 2:3" />Ndiwa kwaikiva nikawayandikila kulihamba lila, lukani panikihika kwa mwenga nikotoho kuhomwa moyu kwa na mwenga wenikupalwa mnipeghi luheku. Nimanyile yiwa nenga paniwela na luheku na mwenga hilahila mtewela na luheku. <verse eid="2CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 2:4" />Paniwayandikilile lihamba lya mtumbulo, niyandikili kunu nikiwela na mnyengemalu na kughasika mmoyu kunu nikilila, niyandikilile ng'ogha ili kuwaghola muweli na mnyengemalo, bali ni kuwalangiha yiwa ninguwapala nesu.<verse eid="2CO 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwalekesela weni kutugholela mahakata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 2:5" />Paikawela na mundu yeyosi kamnyengemalisa mundu hayu kanyengamalisa ng'ogha nenga weka ila kawanyengamalisa mwenga wogha na nenga nipalile ng'ogha kuwakalipila. <verse eid="2CO 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 2:6" />Utoso hula awelile kaupokela kuhuma kwa watangala wa mwenga uhika kunamba yaki. <verse eid="2CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 2:7" />Hinu ni mbaha kwa mundu hayu alekeselwi na kumtaya moyu, ili akotoho kuwela na mnyengemalu nesu na akotoho kutenyuka moyu. <verse eid="2CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 2:8" />Kwa nagha ninguwaluwa nesu, mumlangihi yiwa mngumpala hayu mundu. <verse eid="2CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 2:9" />Lukasini lya nenga kuyandika lihamba lila ni kupala kumanya handa myitikila kughola vila ningupala muweli. <verse eid="2CO 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 2:10" />Pamumlekesela mundu yeyosi uhakata ghaki, na nenga hilahila nimlekesela. Na handa pakawela na kya kumlekesela, hinu ningumlekesela kwaikiva gha mwenga kunu Kilisito akihighilisa, <verse eid="2CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 2:11" />ili tukotoho kumpegha fwasi lihyukana atungongi, kwaikiva tungumanya kila angupala kukighola.<verse eid="2CO 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Holu gha Paulo kummbwani wa Tiloa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 2:12" />Panihikili kummbwani wa Tiloa kutangasa Habali Maha gha Kilisito, Bambu awagholile wandu waweli kala kuniyoghanila. <verse eid="2CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 2:13" />Ila kula ninyengemangili nesu kwaikiva nimlola ng'ogha mlongo ghangu Titusi, hinu nikawataula wandu wa pala na kuyenda kumlima wa Makedonia.<verse eid="2CO 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kilisito angutupegha usindi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 2:14" />Ila tumshukwile Sapanga, machuwa hyogha mweni kutughola tulongosani kwa usindi tukiwela tukongana na Kilisito. Angututumila twenga ili tulandali umanyi wa Kilisito mahala kogha handa vila manungilo maheli yangulandala kogha. <verse eid="2CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 2:15" />Kwaikiva twenga kwa Sapanga, ni handa manungilo maheli gha Kilisito paghati gha wala weni kulokolwa na wenikuyalamika. <verse eid="2CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 2:16" />Kwa wala wenikulokolwa manungilo hagha ni maheli, yanguwapegha ukomu. Ila kwa wandu weni kuyalamika manungilo hagha ni mahakata, na yanguwapegha kihu. Ghuli ni ghani mweni kupalwa kughola lihengu hali? <verse eid="2CO 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 2:17" />Wandu watangala wanguyesa kuipatila unaisa kwa kutangasa ujumbi wa Sapanga. Ila twenga ni watumikila wachakaka wa Sapanga, na kwa makakala gha Kilisito tungumtangasa Kilisito kiuchakaka na Sapanga angumanya.<verse eid="2CO 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CO 3" />
  <para style="s">Watumikila wa Lilaghano lyonu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 3:1" />Ghuli, tungupala lihamba lya kulitambulisa kuhuma kwa mwenga kuwatangasila waghangi? <verse eid="2CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 3:2" />Mwenga weni baha ni lihamba lya twenga, liyandikilwi mumioyu gha twenga, lingumanyika na kusomwa na wandu wogha. <verse eid="2CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 3:3" />Ni lipala yiwa mwenga mwa lihamba lya Kilisito aliyeghili kwa mawoku gha twenga. Lihamba lyeni liyandikwa ng'ogha kwa kalamu ila liyandikwa kwa Mpumulo wa Sapanga mwenikuwela mkomu, kangi muwela ng'ogha handa lihamba lyeni kuyandikwa kunani gha vipandi gha maganga ila lyeni kuyandikwa kumioyu gha wandu.<verse eid="2CO 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 3:4" />Tunguwesa kulonga nagha kwaikiva gha litumaini tuwela nalu kwa Sapanga kwa njila gha Kilisito Yesu. <verse eid="2CO 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 3:5" />Hai ingulangiha ng'ogha yiwa twenga twaweni tunguwesa kughola mghalu wowosi, tuwela na uwesa weni kuhuma kwa Sapanga, <verse eid="2CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 3:6" />hayu ndiwa mweni kutuwesesa kuwela watumikila wa Lilaghanu lya hyonu. Lyenikuwela ng'ogha lilaghano lya laghililo, ila ni Lilaghano lya Mpumulo wa Sapanga. Kwaikiva laghililo liyandikilwi liyeghili kihu, ila Mpumulo wa Sapanga anguyegha ukomu.<verse eid="2CO 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 3:7" />Paikawela utumikila wa laghililo liyeghili kihu lyenikuyandikwa kwa kuhongola kunani gha vipandi vya maganga lihikili kwa ukulu hata Waizilaili wakawela wanguwesa ng'ogha kuulola wuso wa Musa kwaikiva gha hula ung'anyima ghaki pamonga na yiwa uwelili ni wa lipindi lihupi hela. Hinu paikawela utumikila wa laghililo liyandikilwi inguyambusa kihu igholeka kwa ung'anyimo mtangala kwa nagha, <verse eid="2CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 3:8" />Ghuli, lihengu hali lya Mpumulo wa Sapanga litewela ng'ogha mng'anyimo nesu? <verse eid="2CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 3:9" />Hia ghuli mahengu yeni kuyegha ulokola yatewela ng'ogha na ukulu nesu? . <verse eid="2CO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 3:10" />Kukovekelana na hagha ukulu wa lilaghano lya dahile ungulandine ng'ogha na ukulu wa lilaghano lyonu kwaikiva lilaghano lya hyonu liwela na makakala nesu. <verse eid="2CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 3:11" />Hinu handa lila lilaghano lyeni kuwela lya lipindi lihupi liwelili na ukulu, hinaa hali lya machuwa hyogha bila mwihu litewela na ukulu nesu.<verse eid="2CO 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 3:12" />Kwaikiva hali ndiwa litumaini lya twenga hinu tungulonga bila holu. <verse eid="2CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 3:13" />Twenga tungughola ng'ogha handa Musa mweni kupalwa agubiki wuso ghaki ili wandu Izilaili wakotoho kulola hula mwihu wa kusisila kwa mng'anyimo. <verse eid="2CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 3:14" />Ila malangu ghao yakapokwa umanyi. Mbaka lelo pala palisomwa lilaghano lya dahile, kigubiku haki kikali kuwela, kigubiku haki kitehumiswa pala mundu paatemkwinila Kilisito. <verse eid="2CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 3:15" />Hinu nichakaka mbaka lelo pala Waizilaili pawangusoma laghililo lya Musa malangu ghao yanguwoneka yagubikwa. <verse eid="2CO 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 3:16" />Ila kinguwesa kuhumiswa kigubiko haki handa Mayandiko gha Sapanga vila yayandikwa kunani gha Musa, “Kigubiko kyaki kihumiswilwi pala paamhyukile Bambu.” <verse eid="2CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 3:17" />Nagha “Bambu” ndiwa Mpumulo na pala Mpumulo wa Bambu pakawela kwa mundu yoyose, mundu hayu anguwela pekesu. <verse eid="2CO 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 3:18" />Hinu twenga wogha weni kuligubika ng'ogha wuso kwa litambala tunguulangiha ukulu wa Bambu handa kiou vila kingulangiha picha, na twenga tungughalambuswa ili tulandani na mweni kuhuma ukulu mmonga mbaka mghangi na Bambu ndiwa Mpumulo mweni kughola nagha.<verse eid="2CO 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CO 4" />
  <para style="s">Mighalu gha Kimpumulo kuvyombu vya lutupi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 4:1" />Kwaikiva Sapanga katupegha lihengu hali hinu tungutenyuka ng'ogha moyu. <verse eid="2CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 4:2" />Tukanila katu katu kughola matendu gha kifisu yeni honi, hata kuwangonga wandu, hata kuhanganya lilando lya Sapanga na uhwangi ila tungulikala kwa kuulangiha uchakaka ili wandu wogha wamanyi kumioyu ghao yiwa tuwela na uchakaka kuulongolo gha Sapanga. <verse eid="2CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 4:3" />Ila handa Habali Maha hila tunguitangasa imanyika ng'ogha maha kwa wandu, hai ni kwa wala hela weni kukovekela njila gha uyalamiso. <verse eid="2CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 4:4" />Weni wangukwinila ng'ogha kwaikiva yula Lihyukana mlungu wa mlima wogha hau kavika lwisa malangu ghao lukani wakotoho kulola mng'anyimo wa Habali Maha gha ukulu wa Kilisito mwenikuwela mlandano chakaka wa Sapanga. <verse eid="2CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 4:5" />Twenga tungutangasa ng'ogha ujumbi wa twenga twaweni, ila tungumtangasa Yesu Kilisito yiwa ndiwa Bambu, twenga weni ni watumikila wa mwenga kwaikiva gha Yesu. <verse eid="2CO 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 4:6" />Yula Sapanga mweni kulongela, “Mhana na ulangasi kuhuma mlwisa,” ndiwa hayu mweni kulangasa kumioyu gha twenga, na kutuwesesa kumanya ukulu wa Sapanga wenikuwoneka kuwuso wa Kilisito.<verse eid="2CO 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 4:7" />Hinu, twenga tuwela na hupo kulongela ujumbi wa Sapanga, ila twenga tulepelela handa vyombu vya mlutupi, ili iwoneki lipala yiwa makakala hagha makulu yanguhuma kwa Sapanga na ng'ogha kwa twenga wenibaha. <verse eid="2CO 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 4:8" />Tungughaswa kwa ndambu wekaweka, ila tungunyengemala ng'ogha. Na kangi tunguwela na holu, ila tungutenyuka ng'ogha moyu, <verse eid="2CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 4:9" />Wandu wangutuhakila, ila Sapanga kanguleka ng'ogha kututanga, na pawangutuguwisa pahi, twenga tungugholoka kangi. <verse eid="2CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 4:10" />Machuwa hyogha wandu wanguhakula kutukoma handa iwonekanili kwa Yesu. Ili ukomu wa Yesu uwoneki mghati gha twenga. <verse eid="2CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 4:11" />Hinaa, twenga wenikuyendelela kulama machuwa hyogha tunguhakulwa tukomwi kwaikiva gha Yesu, ili ukomu ghaki Yesu upati kuhighiliswa kumihigha gha twenga yeni kuhova. <verse eid="2CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 4:12" />Kwa nagha kihu kingughola lihengu mghati mwa twenga, ila ukomu ungughola lihengu mghati gha twenga.<verse eid="2CO 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 4:13" />Mayandiko gha Sapanga yangulonga, “Nilongile kwaikiva nikwinilili.” kwa Mpumulo hayu hayu wa kuwinila hilahila tungulongela kwaikiva tungukwinila. <verse eid="2CO 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 4:14" />Tungumanya yiwa yula amhindulili Bambu Yesu atetuhindula twenga hilahila pamonga na Yesu na kutuvika kuulongolo ghaki pamonga na mwenga. <verse eid="2CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 4:15" />Mighalu hyogha tunguipokela ni kwaikiva gha mwenga ili umaha wa Sapanga uwahikili wandu watangala, kangi hagha wandu watangala wamshukwile nesu Sapanga na kwa nagha Sapanga ateyendelela kuyinulwa.<verse eid="2CO 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulikala kwa kukwinila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 4:16" />Kwaikiva gha nagha tungutenyuka ng'ogha moyu hata mayaghani. Pamonga na yiwa mihigha gha twenga inguhakala, ila kwa mghati tungugholwa hyonu kila lelo. <verse eid="2CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 4:17" />Kwaikiva hagha mahakilo tungukolwa nayu ni masokombi hela na gha lipindi lihupi hela, na hagha mahakilo yangutuyandala kuwela tukamala machuwa hyogha bila mwihu weni kuyendelela kuwela mtangala. <verse eid="2CO 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 4:18" />Hinu vindu vyeni kuwoneka, vingulikala kulipindi lihupi hela. Na ndiwa kwaikiva twenga tunguvika mkasu kuvindu vila viwesa ng'ogha kuwoneka. Ila vindu vila viwoneka ng'ogha vingulikala machuwa hyogha bila mwihu.<verse eid="2CO 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CO 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 5:1" />Kwaikiva tungumanya yiwa mihigha tungulikala mghati ghaki haku kumlimawogha ni handa mighuta, na hai mighuta gha twenga paiyalamiswa. Tuwela na lighuta lyeni kuhuma kwa Sapanga, lighuta lichengwa ng'ogha kwa mawoko na lyeni kuwela lya machuwa hyogha bila mwihu haku kundumba. <verse eid="2CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 5:2" />Hinaa, lipindi tuwela na mihigha hai mumlima wogha, tungulila mghati kwa mghati, tukiwela na luhujulu lwa kuyenda na kulikala kulighuta lya twenga kundumba. <verse eid="2CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 5:3" />Kwaikiva Sapanga paatetupegha mihigha mihyonu, mipumulo gha twenga itewela na mihigha kulama mghati ghaki machuwa hyogha bila mwihu. <verse eid="2CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 5:4" />Patuwela tukali kulighuta hali lya kumlima wogha ingumaanisa mihigha gha twenga, tungulila kwa kughaswa na mighalu mitangala, ng'ogha kwaikiva tungupala kuwoposola mhigha hau wa kuhova, ila tuwela na luhujulu lwa kuvaliswa hula mhigha wenikuhova ng'ogha, ili hula mhigha weni kuhova ughalambulwi na kuwela mkomu. <verse eid="2CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 5:5" />Sapanga mweni ndiwa mweni kughola maghalambulo hagha, na mweni katupegha Mpumulo ghaki kutughola tumanyi yiwa chakaka ateghola hagha.<verse eid="2CO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 5:6" />Kwa nagha machuwa hyogha tuwela na wakamala, tungumanya yiwa lipindi patuwela kumhigha hau, ni kulikala kutali na Bambu. <verse eid="2CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 5:7" />Kwaikiva tungulama kwa kukwinila, na ng'ogha kulola. <verse eid="2CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 5:8" />Chakaka tuwela na litumaini na tungalipala hata kuhuka kumhigha hau, na kulikala na Bambu. <verse eid="2CO 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 5:9" />Kwa nagha handa tuwela kumhigha hau au tuwela kutali na weni, lukani lwa twenga ni kumuhekelesa Sapanga. <verse eid="2CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 5:10" />Kwaikiva twenga wogha tutegholoka kuulongolo gha kitamilo kya utoso kya Kilisito, ili kila mmonga apokeli kila angupalwa kupokela kukovekelana na ghamaha au ghala mahakata ayagholile lipindi angulikala haku kumlimawogha.<verse eid="2CO 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukonganisu wa twenga na Sapanga kupitila Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 5:11" />Hinu, twenga tungumanya kumtundamila nesu Bambu, na tunguyangala kuwayegha wandu kwa Kilisito. Sapanga kangutumanya kinaga ubaga, na nenga ninguliwachila hilahila mwenga mngutumanya maheli nesu. <verse eid="2CO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 5:12" />Tungupala ng'ogha kuisifila kangi kwa mwenga, ila tungupala kuwalongela kila mngupalwa kuisifila kwaikiva gha twenga, ili mpati kuwela na milando gha kuwayanga wala weni kuidumba kuulongolo gha wandu, wanguleka kuisifila ghala yenikuwela mumioyu ghao. <verse eid="2CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 5:13" />Kwa wandu waghangi, tunguwoneka wandyungi. Na hai ni kwaikiva tungupala kumtumikila Sapanga. Ila patuwoneka na malangu maha, hinu nikwaikiva gha kuwatanga mwenga. <verse eid="2CO 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 5:14" />Kwaikiva mapalo gha Kilisito yangutulongosa wogha weni kumanya yiwa mundu mmonga hela ahovili kwaikiva gha wogha na hai ingumanisa yiwa wogha wangukongine kihu kukyaki. <verse eid="2CO 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 5:15" />Ahovili kwaikiva gha wandu wogha, ili wala wangulama wakotoho kulama kwaikiva gha wenibaha, ila walami kwaikiva gha mweni kuhova na kuhinduka kwaikiva gha weni.<verse eid="2CO 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 5:16" />Nagha kutumbula hinaa na kuyendelela kumlola na kumtosa ng'ogha mundu yeyosi kwa njila gha kimundu, hata handa tumtosili Yesu Kilisito kwa kumlola ila hinaa tungumtosa ng'ogha kangi kwa kumlola. <verse eid="2CO 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 5:17" />Mundu pakanguwela mghati gha Kilisito, kanguwela kiumbi kihyonu, mighalu gha dahile ingupita, na kila kindu kinguwela kihyonu. <verse eid="2CO 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 5:18" />Hyogha hagha yanguhuma kwa Sapanga yula mweni kutukonganisa twenga na mwenibaha kupitila Kilisito, na mweni kangi katupegha lihengu lya kuwakonganisa wandu na Sapanga. <verse eid="2CO 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 5:19" />Hai ingumaanisa, Sapanga ndiwa mwenikuwela akiwakonganisa wandu wogha na mwenibaha kwa njila gha Kilisito akileka kuvalanga sambi syau. Na mweni katupegha ujumbi wa kuwakonganisa wandu.<verse eid="2CO 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 5:20" />Twenga tulaghilwa na Kilisito tulongi na wandu. Na Sapanga mweni angututumila twenga kuwaluwa nesu mwenga, na twenga tunguwaluwa kwa njila gha Kilisito mkonganiswi na Sapanga. <verse eid="2CO 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 5:21" />Kilisito kahela sambi, ila Sapanga amgholili kuwela na sambi kwaikiva gha twenga ili kwa kukonganiswa na hayu Kilisito ili tuwese kughola yala kanguyapala Sapanga.<verse eid="2CO 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CO 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 6:1" />Twenga tungughola lihengu pamonga na Sapanga, tunguwaluwa mkotoho kuleka umaha wa Sapanga muupokelili uyaghaniki hela. <verse eid="2CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 6:2" />Sapanga angulonga kumayandiku ghaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:2">“Lipindi lipalilwi nikuyoghanili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:2">Na kulichuwa lya ulokola nikakutanga”. Hinu, hinaa ndiwa lipindi lya ulokola.<verse eid="2CO 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 6:3" />Hinaa tungughola ng'ogha lolosi lyenikuwesa kuwahakila waghangi, lukani utumikila wa twenga ukotoho kulongelwa maha ng'ogha. <verse eid="2CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 6:4" />Ila tungulangiha yiwa chakaka twenga twa watumikila wa Sapanga kwa kila kindu. Kwa kufumilila kutangala, hata patungukongine na mahakata hyogha. <verse eid="2CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 6:5" />Tutovilwi na kuvikwa mumighuta gha kuwopila wandu na tugholelwa fuju na tungughola mahengu yakamala na tuwonja ng'ogha na tusindili na njala. <verse eid="2CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 6:6" />Tunguhighilisa yiwa twenga ni watumikila wa Sapanga kwaikiva gha ngalilu gha twenga gha moyu maheli, kwa umanyi maha wa lilando lya Sapanga, kwa ufumilifu na kwa upalo wa chakaka na kulongoswa na Mpumulo wa Sapanga, <verse eid="2CO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 6:7" />kangi tunguwonesa kwa njila gha kutangasa ujumbi wa chakaka tungughola hagha hyogha kwa makakala gha Sapanga. Kujumilwa na Sapanga ndiwa vindu vya kutovanila mngondu twenga kwa kila upandi. <verse eid="2CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 6:8" />Tujiyandala kutundamilwa na kupughanywa, na kulongelwa maha ng'ogha na kulongelwa maheli. Tunguwoneka ni wahwangi ila tungulonga uchakaka, <verse eid="2CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 6:9" />handa wandu tumanyika ng'ogha ila tungumanyikana kwa wandu wogha, weni kutovwa ila tuhova ng'ogha na handa wandu weni kuhova ila twa wakomu. <verse eid="2CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 6:10" />Tuwela na unyengemalu nesu, ila tunguwoneka na luheku kila lelo. Tunguwoneka wakapuku, ila tunguwaghola wandu watangala kuwela wanaisa, twawoneka yiwa wandu tuwela ng'ogha na chochose, ila tuwela na kila kindu.<verse eid="2CO 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 6:11" />Walongu Wakolintu, tunguwapala nesu kwa mioyu gha twenga wogha. <verse eid="2CO 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 6:12" />Twenga tuleka ng'ogha kuwapala mwenga, ila mwenga mleka kutupala. <verse eid="2CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 6:13" />Ningulonga na mwenga handa ningulonga na wana ghangu, hinu pepai muwonesi upalo hilahila kwa moyu gha mwenga wogha.<verse eid="2CO 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mkotoho kulikonganisa na wandu weni kummanya ng'ogha Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 6:14" />Mkotoho kukongine na wandu weni kukwinila ng'ogha. Ghuli, umaha na uhakata vitewesa kulikala pamonga? Mhana na lwisa vitewesa kuwela pamonga? <verse eid="2CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 6:15" />Kilisito kanguwesaghuli kuyenda pamonga na Lihyukana? Mundu mweni kukwinila kana ughanja ghani na yula mweni kukwinila ng'ogha? <verse eid="2CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 6:16" />Lighuta lya Sapanga liwela na ughanja ghani na ming'omung'omu gha uhwangi? Kwaikiva twenga ni lighuta lya Sapanga avile mkomu. Handa Sapanga mweni ailongile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:16">“Nitelikala na weni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:16">na kuwela paghati gha weni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:16">Nitewela Sapanga wa weni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:16">na watewela wandu wa nenga.” <verse eid="2CO 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 6:17" />Kwa nagha Bambu angulonga kangi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:17">“Mhuki paghati gha weni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:17">mjibhaghuli paghati gha weni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:17">mkotoho kuyavisa chochosi kyeni kuwela mwiku kwa mwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:17">na nenga nitewapokela. <verse eid="2CO 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 6:18" />Nenga nitewela Tati wa mwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:18">mwenga mtewela wana wa nenga, walumi kwa wadala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:18">Bambu mweni makakala angulonga.”<verse eid="2CO 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CO 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 7:1" />Walongo ghangu wapalwa kwaikiva tuwela na malaghanu hagha hinu tujighululi kwa kuleka mighalu hyogha yeni kutughola tokotoho kujumilika na Sapanga kumhigha na kumpumulo na tuyangalai kuwela wandu wa Sapanga tukilikala kukumtundamila Sapanga.<verse eid="2CO 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo kana luheku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 7:2" />Waghanja wa nenga tunguluwa mtupali, tumkosela ng'ogha mundu yeyosi, na tumbyodosa ng'ogha mundu yeyosi, hata kumpokola hindu mundu yeyosi. <verse eid="2CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 7:3" />Ningulonga ng'ogha mighalu hai ili kuwatosa mwenga yiwa mkosa, nilongola kulongela hagha, kwaikiva mwenga muwela kumioyu gha twenga kwa kukala pamonga, na hata kuhova pamonga. <verse eid="2CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 7:4" />Ninguwela ng'ogha na holu paningulonga na mwenga, Ninguitutumulila nesu mwenga, pamonga na maghasu hyogha yatukolile, nipeghilwi moyu nesu na mnighola niweli na luheku nesu.<verse eid="2CO 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 7:5" />Patuhikili Makidonia, tupumulila ng'ogha. Tughasikili kwa ndambu weka weka, magombi na wandu waghangi na kumioyu gha twenga kuwelili na holu. <verse eid="2CO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 7:6" />Ila Sapanga mweni kuwataya moyu wandu weni kunyenyema, akatutaya moyu twenga hilahila kwa kumyegha Titusi kwa twenga. <verse eid="2CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 7:7" />Ng'ogha kwa kuhika kwaki Titusi hela, ila kwa vila mumpeghili moyu. Mweni katulongela vila muwela na luhujulu lwa kunilola, na vila muwela na unyengemalo, na vila mngughola kila kindu kwaikiva gha kunitanga. Mghalu hau ungunihekelesa nesu.<verse eid="2CO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 7:8" />Hata paikawela niwahoma moyu, kwa lihamba lila lya mtumbulo, ila ninguliwachila ng'ogha yiwa nikosela, ningumanya yiwa lihamba hali liwanyengamasili mwenga ila ni kwa lipindi lihupi hela. <verse eid="2CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 7:9" />Hinaa ninguhekelela, ila ng'ogha kwaikiva niwagholile mnyengemali, ni kwaikiva unyengamalu wa mwenga uwaghola mghalambuki na kuleka sambi. Unyengamalu hau uyeghilwi na Sapanga, na kwa nagha twenga tuwahakila ng'ogha kwa ndambu yeyosi. <verse eid="2CO 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 7:10" />Unyengamalu weni kuyeghwa kwa kupala Sapanga lunguyegha kuhyuka na kuhyuka haku kunguyegha ulokola, hinu ungupalwa ng'ogha kuijutila. Ila unyengemalu hula wenikuyeghwa na wandu unguyegha kihu. <verse eid="2CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 7:11" />Mloli hinu! Unyengemalu weni kuyeghwa kwa kupala Sapanga hau uwayeghela fwaida ngulu, uwaghola kuwela na luhujulu lukulunga lwa kughola mighalu yeni kuwatanga, mnguwesa kulitetela yiwa mighalu mnguighola ni chakaka, kuuhyomela uhakata, kumtundamila Sapanga, na kuwela na luhujulu lwa kunilola, na kulola yiwa yula mwenikukosela kagholwa vila ingupalwa agholwi. Ku hagha hyogha ingulangiha yiwa mkosela ng'ogha lolosi kumghalu hau.<verse eid="2CO 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 7:12" />Hinu, niwayandikilile ng'ogha lihamba kwaikiva gha yula mweni kukosela au yula mweni kukoselwa, ila kuyangala kwa mwenga kwaikiva gha twenga kupati kuhighiliswa kuulongolo gha Sapanga. <verse eid="2CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 7:13" />Na hali ndiwa liwelili litugangamalisa twenga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 7:13">Tupeghilwi moyu nesu, ila hilahila Titusi atuhekelesili pala pakatulongela vila mumhekelesa kumoyu. <verse eid="2CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 7:14" />Nenga niwasifila nesu kuulongolo gha Titusi na kumghalu hau mnipegha ng'ogha honi. Tuwalongeli uchakaka machuwa hyogha na kula kuwasifila mwenga kuulongolo ghaki kuwelili mghalu wa uchakaka hela. <verse eid="2CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 7:15" />Nagha upalo wa mweni mkulu kwa mwenga unguyongeseka nesu, pala paangukumbuka uyitikila wa mwenga wogha na vila mumpokela maha kangi kwa holu na kuhihimila. <verse eid="2CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 7:16" />Niwela na luheku kwaikiva ninguwesa kuwakwinila kukila mghalu.<verse eid="2CO 7:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CO 8" />
  <para style="s">Kupegha kwa moyu wa kupala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 8:1" />Walongo, tungupala kuwapegha habali gha umaha wa Sapanga augholili kumapinga gha wandu wamkwinila Kilisito gha haku Makidonia. <verse eid="2CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 8:2" />Wakwinila hagha wayesilwi nesu na maghasu, ila luheku lwau luhighalile kuwela lukulu, hata wakapegha kwa moyu wa kupegha nesu, pamonga na yiwa wawelili wakapuku nesu. <verse eid="2CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 8:3" />Ninguwesa kuwalongela yiwa kwa uwesa wa weni, na kupiti uwesa wawela nau, kwa kupala kwau wakapegha hindu ghao, <verse eid="2CO 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 8:4" />watuluwili nesu wapeghwi fwasi gha kukongine na twenga kughola lihengu lya kuwatanga wandu wa Sapanga. <verse eid="2CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 8:5" />Kangi wagholile maha kupiti vila tutumainili, mtumbulo wajihumisili kwa Bambu, na kwa twenga hilahila, handa aipalile Sapanga. <verse eid="2CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 8:6" />Titusi ndiwa mweni mwenikuwaghola mtumbuli lihengu hali maheli kwa mwenga, hinu tumluwili awatangi mwenga kuyomola utumikila hau wa upalo. <verse eid="2CO 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 8:7" />Mwenga muwela na kila kindu, kukukwinila, kuuwesa wa kulonga, umanyi, kuuwesa wa kutanga kwa njila yoyosi, na kuupalo wa mwenga kwa twenga. Hinu kangi tunguwapala muweli na mpumulo wa upalo kulihengu hali lya kuwatanga waghangi.<verse eid="2CO 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 8:8" />Ninguwalasimisa ng'ogha, ila ningupala kuwalangiha vila waghangi wawela na kuyangala kukuwatanga waghangi, ili mbati kumanya vila upalo wa mwenga uwela wa chakaka. <verse eid="2CO 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 8:9" />Kwaikiva mwenga mngumanya umaha wa Bambu wa twenga Yesu Kilisito, pamonga na yiwa awelili na kila kindu, akajighola kapuku kwaikiva gha mwenga, ili kukovekelana na ukapuku ghaki muweli wanaisa.<verse eid="2CO 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 8:10" />Hali ndiwa ningupala kuwalongela mwenga, yiwa lichuva lya lichu mwenga muwelili wa mtumbulo kupegha hindu gha mwenga na kuwela na luhujulu lwa kughola nagha. <verse eid="2CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 8:11" />Hinu, mtimilisi lihengu hali, na handa vila muwelili na luhujulu lukulu lwa kutanga, hinu myangalai kupegha kukovekelana na uwesa muwela nau. <verse eid="2CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 8:12" />Kwaikiva handa mundu paakawela na moyu wa kupegha, Sapanga angujumila kila kindu angukipegha, Sapanga kangupala ng'ogha kikulu kupiti kila uwela nachu.<verse eid="2CO 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 8:13" />Lukasini lwa twenga, ng'ogha kulonga mwenga mghasiki na mihighu gha kuwatanga waghangi ila tungupala mlandani. <verse eid="2CO 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 8:14" />Ila kwaikiva kwa hinaa muwela navyu ni maha kuwapegha wala weni kulepelelwa ili lichuwa mwenga pamtewela walepelelwa na weni watewatanga mwenga, kwa nagha na wogha mtewela mtangana. <verse eid="2CO 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 8:15" />Kwakughola nagha mtewela mtimilisa yala mayandiko yalongile, “Yula kakungula vitangala, kakungula ng'ogha kupiti myaki, hata yula kakungula mayaghani kapungukilwa ng'ogha.”<verse eid="2CO 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Titusi angulaghilwa ku Kolintu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 8:16" />Ningumshukwile Sapanga kwaikiva ampeghili Titusi awelili na luhujulu lwa kupala kuwatanga handa nenga vila niwela na luhujulu lwa kuwatanga. <verse eid="2CO 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 8:17" />Titusi kayitikila kughola vila tumluwili, kangi mwenibaha kwa kupala kwaki apalili nesu kuwatanga. <verse eid="2CO 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 8:18" />Pamonga na Titusi, hilahila tungumuyegha mlongo wa twenga mghangi hayu angutundamilwa nesu kukutangasa Habali Maha kumalipinga hyogha yeni kumkwinila Kilisito. <verse eid="2CO 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 8:19" />Kangi mapinga gha wandu yenikumkwinila Kilisito, yamhaghula mlongo wa twenga hayu ili aweli pamonga na twenga patuyegha mtanga kwa wandu. Lihengu hali, lingumghola Sapanga ayinulwi, kangi lingulangiha vila tungughola kuyangala kuwatanga waghangi.<verse eid="2CO 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 8:20" />Tunguwela na mwanja na mlongo hayu ili kuhyeta kulalamikilwa kuugholokela wa twenga kuhupo hai tunguitumikila. <verse eid="2CO 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 8:21" />Lukasini lwa twenga ni kughola gha maha, ng'ogha kuulongolo gha Bambu hela, ila hilahila kuulongolo gha wandu.<verse eid="2CO 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 8:22" />Hinu pamonga na walongo hagha, tumlaghila mlongo wa twenga mghangi, hayu tumyesa mihanja mitangala tukalola yiwa kana luhujulu lukulunga lwa kuwatanga, hata hinaa kawela na moyu nesu kwaikiva kana kukwinila nesu na mwenga. <verse eid="2CO 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 8:23" />Hayu Titusi ni myangu, tungughola mahengu pamonga kwaikiva gha mwenga, ila hagha wandu waghangi waivili walaghilwa na mapinga maghangi gha weni kumkwinila Kilisito, na kila wangukighola kingumpegha Kilisito utundamilu. <verse eid="2CO 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 8:24" />Kwa nagha muwonesi upalo wa mwenga kwa weni, ili mapinga maghangi yeni kumkwinila Kilisito yahighilisi yiwa nichakaka twenga tuwela na upalo, kwa nagha tuweli na lukani lwa kuisifila kunani gha mwenga.<verse eid="2CO 8:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CO 9" />
  <para style="s">Kuwatanga Wakilisito waghangi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 9:1" />Kwahela lukani lwa nenga kuwayandikila mwenga yala yeni kulongela kuwatanga watumikila wa haku kumlima wa Yudasia. <verse eid="2CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 9:2" />Kwaikiva ningumanya vila muwela na moyu wa kutanga, na nijitutumulili kuwalongela watumikila wa Bambu wa haku Makedonia yiwa “Walongo wa twenga wa Akaya” waliyandala kuhuma lichuva lya lichu. Hinu kuyangala kwa mwenga kupegha kuwasosela wandu watangala. <verse eid="2CO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 9:3" />Hinu, niwalaghila walongo wa twenga hagha, ili kuisifila kunani gha mwenga kukotoho kuwoneka yiwa ni milando hela, ila iwoneki yiwa mliyandala na muwela na hau mtanga handa niilongile. <verse eid="2CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 9:4" />Kwaikiva handa panihika haku pamonga na Wamakedonia na kulola mliyandala ng'ogha hai itewela honi kunani gha litumaini lwa twenga kwa mwenga kangi mwenga mtewela na honi yeni kuwesa ng'ogha kulongeleka. <verse eid="2CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 9:5" />Kwa nagha nilola yiwa maha nesu kuwaluwa hagha walongo wa twenga Titusi na wayaki, watulongoli kuhika kwa mwenga, ili muyandali ndambu gha kukungula hupo hila tulaghanili mtepegha kwa mapalo muwela nayu. <verse eid="2CO 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 9:6" />Walongo mkumbwiki milando hai, “Yula mweni kukulila mbeyu mayaghani, atebena mabeno mayaghani, ila yula atekulila mbeyu zitangala atebena mabeno yatangala.” <verse eid="2CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 9:7" />Kila mmonga wa mwenga apeghi kila kalumula kupegha kuhuma kumoyu ghaki, ng'ogha kwa uwimi au kulasimiswa, kwaikiva Sapanga angumpala yula mundu mweni kupala kupegha kwa luheku. <verse eid="2CO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 9:8" />Sapanga kanguwesa kuwapegha mwenga kupiti vila mngupala kupokela, ili pamuwela na kila kindu mpati kupegha kukila lihengu maha. <verse eid="2CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 9:9" />Handa iyandikilwi ku Mayandiko gha Sapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 9:9">“Kapegha kwa moyu wogha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 9:9">na anguwapegha wakapuku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 9:9">umaha ghaki utelikala machuwa hyogha bila mwihu.” <verse eid="2CO 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 9:10" />Sapanga mweni kumpegha mtukutula mbeyu, na mulyo kwa kila mmonga, hilahila atewapegha mwenga mbeyu mzipala, na ateghola zimeli, na zikuli na kuwapegha mabeno matangala mnguyapokela kwaikiva gha kupegha kwa mwenga lwa moyu. <verse eid="2CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 9:11" />Mwenga mtegholwa kuwela wanaisa kukila kindu ili machuwa hyogha mulangihi moyu wa kupegha. Na Sapanga ateyinulwa kwa lihengu tuligholile kwa mwenga. <verse eid="2CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 9:12" />Kwaikiva utumikila hau maha munguughola ng'ogha kwaikiva gha kukwila malepelelu wawela nayu watumikila wa Sapanga, ila hilahila kunguwaghola wandu watangala wamshukwile Sapanga. <verse eid="2CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 9:13" />Kukovekelana na ghala yeni kuwoneka kulihengu lya twenga hali, wandu watemyinula Sapanga kwaikiva gha mwenga kukwinila Habali Maha gha Kilisito munguitangasa kuulongolo gha wandu, na kwaikiva gha moyu wa kupala kuwapegha wandu wogha hindu gha mwenga. <verse eid="2CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 9:14" />Kwa nagha watewayupila mwenga kwa moyu, kwaikiva gha umaha muulangisili. <verse eid="2CO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 9:15" />Tumshukwile Sapanga kwaikiva gha hupo ghaki ngulu, yeni kuwesa ng'ogha kulandaniswa atupeghili!<verse eid="2CO 9:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CO 10" />
  <para style="s">Paulo angutetela lihengu lyaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 10:1" />Nenga Paulo mweni kuwoneka mnyalinyali paninguwela pamonga na mwenga, ila ni mkalipa paninguwela kutali na mwenga, ninguwaluwa nesu kwa unyenyekela na unyalinyali wa Kilisito. <verse eid="2CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 10:2" />Ninguwaluwa ili pala panitehika kwa mwenga, mkotoho kunighola niweli mkalipa. Kiuchakaka nitewela mkalipa nesu kwa wala wogha wenikuliwachila yiwa twenga twa handa wandu wamtundamila ng'ogha Sapanga. <verse eid="2CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 10:3" />Pamonga na yiwa tungulikala kumlima wogha, ila tungutovana ng'ogha ngondu handa vila wandu wa kumlimawogha wangutovana. <verse eid="2CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 10:4" />Kwaikiva vila vindu tungutumila patungutovana, ng'ogha vitovanilu vya kumlima wogha hau, ila ni makakala gha Sapanga yeni kubomola ngomi zyogha, tunguyalamisa mawachilo hyogha gha uhwangi, <verse eid="2CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 10:5" />na kubomola kila ngingamu yeni kugholoka na kungingama umanyi wa Sapanga, tungukamula kwa makakala mawachilo hyogha na kuyaghola yamyitikili Sapanga. <verse eid="2CO 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 10:6" />Pamuwela mnguyitikila nesu, twenga tutemnyokola kila mundu mweni kuyitikila ng'ogha. <verse eid="2CO 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 10:7" />Mwenga mngumlola mighalu kwa panje hela. Ikiva kuwela na yeyosi mweni kuliwachila yiwa mweni ni hindu gha Kilisito weka yaki, hayu na atuwachilile na twenga hilahila twa hindu gha Kilisito handa vila mweni kawela. <verse eid="2CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 10:8" />Ningulola ng'ogha honi kuisifila uweso hula Bambu katupegha, kwaikiva uwesa hau ng'ogha wa kuwabomola ila wakuwatanga kuwachenga kuukwinila. <verse eid="2CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 10:9" />Nenga mbala ng'ogha mliwachili namkalipa kwa ghala niwayandikilile. <verse eid="2CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 10:10" />Mundu anguwesa kulonga, “Milando iyandikilwi na Paulo yawelili makalipa nesu, ila paanguwela na twenga kangukalipa ng'ogha, na milando ghaki paangulonga ni gha unyalinyali.” <verse eid="2CO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 10:11" />Mundu handa hayu angupalwa amanyi yiwa kwahela mlekanu wowosi paghati gha milando tuyandika patunguwela kutali, ila ndiwa tungughola patunguwela ndundandunda. <verse eid="2CO 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 10:12" />Kwaikiva tunguwesa ng'ogha kuyesa kujivika au kuilandanisa na wala wandu weni kuisifila weni. Wandu weni kuilola yiwa weni bahala ni kipimu kya kuipimila, na wandu weni kuilandanisa weni kwa weni, hagha ni wandyungi. <verse eid="2CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 10:13" />Ila twenga tuteisifila ng'ogha kupiti vila tunguwela, kuisifila haku kutehighala kukila kipimu kya lihengu lila atupeghili Sapanga, lihengu lila tungulighola hilahila kwa mwenga. <verse eid="2CO 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 10:14" />Handa tungawela tungulidumba tungalihika ng'ogha kwa mwenga, ila twenga tuwelili wa mtumbulo kuhika kwa mwenga kutangasa Habali Maha gha Kilisito. <verse eid="2CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 10:15" />Kangi tunguisifila ng'ogha kunani gha mundu mghangi, ila tungutegemela ukwinila wa mwenga vila unguyendelela kuyengeseka kukula, lihengu lya twenga litewela linguwoneka likulunga nesu. <verse eid="2CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 10:16" />Kwa nagha tutewesa kutangasa Habali Maha kumlima mghangi kutali na mwenga muwela. Kwaikiva tungupala ng'ogha kuisifila lihengu ligholeka kala na mundu mghangi kumahala kughangi. <verse eid="2CO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 10:17" />Handa Mayandiko vila yayandikwa, “Mweni kuisifila na aisifili kwa kughola lihengu lya Bambu.” <verse eid="2CO 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 10:18" />Kwaikiva mundu mweni kujumilika ng'ogha yula mweni kuisifila mweni, ila ni yula mundu mweni kusifilwa na Bambu.<verse eid="2CO 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CO 11" />
  <para style="s">Paulo na wandumindumi weni kuvula uhwangi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 11:1" />Ningapala handa mnganifumilila mayaghani, pamonga na yiwa ningulongela undyungi. Pepai mnifumilili. <verse eid="2CO 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 11:2" />Nenga ningulola wifu kwaikiva gha mwenga ila ni wifu wa Sapanga. Kwaikiva mwenga ni handa msikana mweni kuwela kambila kuwonja na mlumi nenga nikawela msenga ghaki kwa Kilisito. <verse eid="2CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 11:3" />Ila ninguwela na holu yiwa, handa vila Eva, angongilwi na yula njoka mweni kuwela kakalamuka, na mwenga mkangongwa mkaleka kumpala Kilisito kwa mioyu gha mwenga yenikuwela maha. <verse eid="2CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 11:4" />Kwaikiva mwenga mnguwoneka mnguwesa kumpokela na kumjumila mundu yeyosi, mwenikuhika kwa mwenga na kuwalongela Yesu mghangi tumtangasili ng'ogha twenga, au mkapokela mpumulo mghangi mwenikuwela ng'ogha yula mumpokelili, na Habali Maha ilandine ng'ogha na hila tuwatangasilile twenga! <verse eid="2CO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 11:5" />Nenga ninguliwachila yiwa wala wenikujikema yiwa “Wandumindumi wakulu,” wangulekanika ng'ogha na nenga. <verse eid="2CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 11:6" />Inguwesekana nenga niwesa ng'ogha kulongela maha handa hagha wandumindumi waghangi, ila ningumanya mighalu mitangala na mighalu hai tuilangiha kumahala wekaweka kwa mwenga.<verse eid="2CO 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 11:7" />Nenga nitangasili kwa mwenga Habali Maha gha Sapanga, bila lihomosi, nikalihulusa ili mbati kuwayinula mwenga. Ghuli, niwelili ngosela? <verse eid="2CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 11:8" />Panigholile lihengu kwa mwenga, vila nivipalile ili mbati kulama vihumili kumapinga maghangi yeni kumkwinila Kilisito, kwa kughola nagha ni handa niwapokela vindu ili mbati kuwatumikila mwenga. <verse eid="2CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 11:9" />Paniwelili na mwenga nimghasa ng'ogha mundu yoyose panipala vindu, walongo kuhuma kumlima wa Makidonia wanyeghilili kila kindu nikipalili. Nikotoho kuwaghasa kwa lipindi lila, na niteyendelela ng'ogha kuwaghasa. <verse eid="2CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 11:10" />Kiuchakaka kwahela mundu yeyosi kumlima wa Akaya mwenikuwesa kungingama nenga nikotoho kuisifila kwa hali. Ningulongela hali kukovekelana na chakaka gha Kilisito yeni kuwela mghati gha nenga. <verse eid="2CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 11:11" />Ghuli, hai ingumaanisa ninguwapala ng'ogha? Ng'ogha, Sapanga angumanya yiwa ninguwapala!<verse eid="2CO 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 11:12" />Niteyendelela kughola handa ningughola hinaa, ili wandumindumi hagha wenikulikema yiwa, “Wandumindumi wakulu” wasindwi kya kuisifila yiwa wangughola lihengu handa twenga. <verse eid="2CO 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 11:13" />Kwaikiva weni ni wandumindumi wa uhwangi, wangughola lihengu kwa uhwangi wanguighola yiwa wandumindumi wa Kilisito. <verse eid="2CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 11:14" />Hau ng'ogha mghalu wa kukangasa, kwaikiva hata Lihyukana hilahila linguighola kuwela mtumikila wa mhana! <verse eid="2CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 11:15" />Kwa nagha ikangasa ng'ogha, kwaikiva hata watumikila ghaki wanguwesa kulighola wawoneki handa watumikila wa maha kwa Sapanga. Kumwihu watemanyika kwa matendu ghao.<verse eid="2CO 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mahakilo gha Paulo handa mndumindumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 11:16" />Ninguwalongela kangi, akotoho kuwela mundu yeyosi mwenikuliwachila yiwa nenga na ndyungi. Ila paikawela nagha, hinu mniwachili handa mndyungi, ili mbati kuisifila hata mayaghani. <verse eid="2CO 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 11:17" />Milando hai ninguilongela gha kuisifila inguhuma ng'ogha kwa Bambu, ila ningulongela mweni handa mundu mndyungi. <verse eid="2CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 11:18" />Kwaikiva wandu watangala wanguisifila handa vila wandu wa mlima wogha waighola, nenga hilahila niteisifila. <verse eid="2CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 11:19" />Mwenga munguilola yiwa muwela na luhala ndiwa kwaikiva mnguyenda pamonga na wandyungi. <verse eid="2CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 11:20" />Mngufumilila na kumjumila hata mundu mweni kuwavika kuuhusutu, mwenikuwahijila na kuwapokola hindu, kangi angulisifila na kuwatofa kuwuso! <verse eid="2CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 11:21" />Ninguilolela honi kujumila yiwa twenga tuwelili walepelelwa kumighalu hyogha!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 11:21">Ila paikawela mundu kanguwesa kuisifila kwa kindu chochosi, nenga hilahila niteisifila, ila kuisifila haku ni kindu kya undyungi. <verse eid="2CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 11:22" />Ikawela weni ni Wahebulania, hata nenga muebulania. Hilahila ikawela weni ni Waizilaili na nenga ni Muizilaili. Na ikawela weni ni kiwelekwa kya Ibulahimu, na nenga ni muwelekwa wa Ibulahimu. Ghuli, weni ni Waizilaeli? Hata nenga. Weni ni wawelekwa wa Abulahamu? Hata nenga. <verse eid="2CO 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 11:23" />Hinaa nitelongela handa mndyungi, ikiva weni ni watumikila wa Kilisito, nenga ni mtumikila ghaki kupiti weni. Nitumikila mahengu matangala nesu, niwopwa mihanja itangala nesu, nitovwa nesu, na mihanja itangala nityelembukili kukihu. <verse eid="2CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 11:24" />Mihanja itano nitovwa hyatu iselasini na tisa na Wayahudi. <verse eid="2CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CO 11:25" />Nitovilwi hyatu mihanja itatu na Waloma, nikatovwa maganga lihanja limonga wakipala kunikoma, nikavetukililwa na whatu ngulunga mihanja itatu, na lihanja limonga nilikalile uhiku wogha na kusinda pamuhi hyogha kubahali. <verse eid="2CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CO 11:26" />Kumihanja ghangu wekaweka, nikonganili na pabehi na kuhova kumilweni, pabehi kuhova na wapokola, pabehi kuhova kuhuma kwa walongo ghangu, pabehi kuhova kuhuma kwa wandu wa panji, pabehi kuhova kumbwani, pabehi kuhova kumhitu, pabehi kuhova mbahali, pabehi kuhova kuhuma kwa walongo wa uhwangi. <verse eid="2CO 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CO 11:27" />Nigholile mahengu na kughasika, niwonjili ng'ogha mihanja itangala, niwelili na njala na uyumililo, mihanja itangala niwopili mulyo na kulikala kulupepo bila nguu zya kuikingila lupepo. <verse eid="2CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CO 11:28" />Kupiti hagha hyogha, niwelili nikiwachila mapinga hyogha yeni kumkwinila Kilisito. <verse eid="2CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CO 11:29" />Mundu pakawela kahela makakala na nenga ningulilola nahela makakala, hilahila mundu pakamghola mundu agholi sambi, nenga ninguhyoma.<verse eid="2CO 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CO 11:30" />Handa patewela na ulasima kuisifila, hinu niteisifila hila mighalu yenikulangiha ulepelelo ghangu. <verse eid="2CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CO 11:31" />Sapanga Tati wa Bambu Yesu, mweni kuyinulwa machuwa hyogha bila mwihu, angumanya yiwa ningulongela ng'ogha uhwangi. <verse eid="2CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CO 11:32" />Paniwelili Damasiko, yula mwenikuwela mkulu wa mmbwani pahi gha Nkosi Aleta avikili watova ngondo ili wanikamuli. <verse eid="2CO 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CO 11:33" />Ila nihulusilwi nikiwela mkibeja kikulunga kupitila fwasi zya muluambasa, na nenga nikawesa kunyelembuka.<verse eid="2CO 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CO 12" />
  <para style="s">Mighalu kalangiliwa na kugubutulilwa Paulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 12:1" />Hinu niteyendelela kuisifila pamonga na yiwa mbata ng'ogha fwaida! Ila ningupalwa kuisifila, kumighalu anilangilili Bambu na kunigubutulila. <verse eid="2CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 12:2" />Ningummanya mundu mmonga mweni kumkwinila Kilisito, na hinaa ipiti kala machuva ikumi na njechi, mundu hayu atolilwi kunani mbaka kundumba kutali nesu handa atolilwi kumhigha au awelili ku Mpumulo, Sapanga weka yaki ndiwa angumanya. <verse eid="2CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 12:3" />Handa niilongile, ni Sapanga hela ndiwa mweni kumanya yiwa mundu hayu kwa lipindi lila awelili kumhigha au Mpumulo, <verse eid="2CO 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 12:4" />haku akahyoghanila mighalu mitopa kuihimulila, mighalu iwela mundu kanguwesa ng'ogha kuihimulila. <verse eid="2CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 12:5" />Hinu, niteisifila kwa habali gha mundu hayu, na ng'ogha kwa habali gha nenga mwenibaha, niteisifila ulepelelwa ghangu. <verse eid="2CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 12:6" />Handa ningalipala kuisifila, ningawela ng'ogha mndyungi, kwaikiva ningawela ningulonga uchakaka hela. Ila niteisifila ng'ogha kwaikiva ningupala ng'ogha mundu yeyosi akanilola nenga ni mundu mkulu nesu kupiti vila ninguwoneka kughala ninguyaghola na kuhyoghanila.<verse eid="2CO 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 12:7" />Ila, lukani mighalu hai mikulunga nigubutulilwi ikotoho kunighola niloweli kuisifila, nipeghilwi mahakilo makalipa kumhigha handa mhomi, na hayu ni handa mjumbi wa Lihyukana mweni kunitova, ili nikotoho kuisifila kupiti vila iwela. <verse eid="2CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 12:8" />Nimyupili nesu Bambu mihanja miitatu anihumisili mhomi hau. <verse eid="2CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 12:9" />Ila akaniyanga, “Umaha ghangu ungukukwila, kwaikiva makakala ghangu yanguwoneka pala pauwela ng'ogha na makakala.” Hinu, ninguhekelela nesu kuisifila ulepelelo ghangu, ili uwesa wa Kilisito ulikali mghati gha nenga. <verse eid="2CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 12:10" />Kwa nagha ningujumila na ninguhekelelela ulepelelo ghangu, wandu wanguwesa kunilihu nenga, na paniwela mmaghaso, hata panihakilwa ili Kilisito ayinulwi. Kwaikiva lipindi paninguwela nilepelela, ndiwa lipindi Kilisito angunipegha makakala.<verse eid="2CO 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo ni mndumindumi wa chakaka wa Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 12:11" />Nenga niwoneka handa mndyungi, ila mwenga myambusa niweli nagha. Mwenga ndiwa mngalipalwa kunisifila, pamonga na yiwa nenga ninguwoneka nakindu ng'ogha, nenga na mnung'una ng'ogha kupiti weni kuilongela yiwa ni “Wandumindumi wakulu.” <verse eid="2CO 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 12:12" />Lipindi paniwelili kwa mwenga niwelile na ufumilifu na kughola makangaso na vilangihi vyeni kunilangiha yiwa nenga na mndumindumi wa Sapanga. <verse eid="2CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 12:13" />Kwahela mghalu wowosi niugholile kumalipinga maghangi gha wandu weni kumkwinila Kilisito na nilighola ng'ogha kwa mwenga, pangi niwakosela kwaikiva niluwili ng'ogha mtanga kwa vindu ninguvipala, handa hali ndiwa nikosela hinu ninguluwa mnilekeseli.<verse eid="2CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 12:14" />Hinaa ninguliyandala kuhika kwa mwenga lihanja lya itatu, na nitewela ng'ogha na kya kutola kwa mwenga. kwaikiva kila ninguhakula ng'ogha hindu gha mwenga, ila ni mwenga maweni. Machuwa hyogha walela ndiwa wanguwavikila wana vindu na ng'ogha wana kuwavikila vindu walela. <verse eid="2CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 12:15" />Hinu nitehekelela kuhumisa vyogha niwela navyu hata kujihumisa mweni kwaikiva gha kuwatanga. Ghuli mtenipala mayaghani kwaikiva nenga niwapalile nesu?<verse eid="2CO 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 12:16" />Hinu, kwaikiva niwaghasili ng'ogha kwa kupala hindu kwa mwenga, Ila pangi mundu mghangi atelonga, “Kwa vila Paulo ni mweni malangu, kawakamula kwa ukambenga.” <verse eid="2CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 12:17" />Ghuli, nitolili kindu chochose kwa mwenga kwa kuwalulunyanya kupitila wala niwalahighilili? <verse eid="2CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 12:18" />Nimluwili Titusi ahiki kwa mwenga, pamonga na mlongo wa twenga mghangi. Ghuli, Titusi atolili chochosi kwa mwenga? Hinu kwa nagha mmanyi yiwa matendu na ndyangilu gha nenga ni ghala ghala handa gha mweni Titusi.<verse eid="2CO 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 12:19" />Ghuli, mwenga munguliwachila yiwa kwa lipindi hali lyogha twenga tungulitetela kuulongolo gha mwenga? Twenga tungulongela mighalu hai kuulongolo gha Sapanga tukiwela tukongana na Kilisito. Walongo wapalwa, mighalu hai hyogha ni kwaikiva gha kuwachenga mwenga kuukwinila. <verse eid="2CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 12:20" />Kwaikiva ningutila yiwa lipindi panitehika kwa mwenga, nitewalola ng'ogha vila ninguwachila muwela, na mwenga hilahila ningutila mtenilola ng'ogha vila mnguwachila niwela. Ningutila kuwalola muwela weni mabisanu, na weni wifu na weni lilaka na mkitovana kwa kuipala weni na weni kulongela maha ng'ogha na weni kuwalongela wayenu, na weni kinyengu na mikologhanyu haku. <verse eid="2CO 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 12:21" />Ikotoho kuhumila pala panitehika kwa mwenga, Sapanga akaghola niloli honi kuulongolo gha mwenga. Na nenga nitelila kwaikiva gha watangala gha wala wagholile sambi na wakaleka kumuhuyila Bambu, wambila kuwela na ndyangilu maha ng'ogha gha ngongola na lumatamata lughangi lula wawelili nalu.<verse eid="2CO 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CO 13" />
  <para style="s">Mwanja wa itatu wa Paulo haku Kolintu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 13:1" />Hali litewela lihanja lya itatu kwa nenga kuhika kwa mwenga. Na handa mayandiko vila yayandikwa, “Lilando au mghalu wowosi ni lasima uhighiliswi na wandu waivili au waitatu weni kuwesa kulola na kuhyoghanila.” <verse eid="2CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 13:2" />Niwalongelili kala paniwelili pamonga na mwenga lila lihanja lya ipili. Hinaa niwela kutali na mwenga, ila ninguwakanisa kangi, yiwa panitehika kangi nitewaleka ng'ogha yaghi yaghi wala wogha wenikughola sambi na waleka ng'ogha na kumkovekela Sapanga. <verse eid="2CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 13:3" />Kwaikiva mngupala uhighilisu yiwa Kilisito angulongela kwa kunitumila nenga. Mweni kalepelela ng'ogha pakapala kuwanyokola mwenga, ila kana makakala paghati gha mwenga. <verse eid="2CO 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 13:4" />Pamonga na yiwa Kilisito awelili kahela makakala lipindi anguvambwa kulipingika na kuhova, ila hinaa angulama kwa makakala gha Sapanga, hinu kwa kukonganika na mweni twenga hilahila tunguwela twahela makakala, ila patunguwakanisa mwenga, tutewela wakomu pamonga na Kilisito kumakakala gha Sapanga. <verse eid="2CO 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 13:5" />Mjiloli mwenga maweni, ili mpati kumanya yiwa Kilisito kamghati gha mwenga, paikawela mmanya ng'ogha, mtewela muwela ng'ogha na ukwinila. <verse eid="2CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 13:6" />Ila ningukwinila mwenga mtemanya yiwa twenga twa ng'ogha wandu wa kusindwa. <verse eid="2CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 13:7" />Tungumyupa Sapanga kwaikiva gha mwenga mkotoho kughola uhakata wowosi, ng'ogha kwa lukani lwa kuwoneka yiwa tusinda, ila lukani mpati kughola ghamaha, hata twenga tuwoneki handa tusindwa. <verse eid="2CO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 13:8" />Kwaikiva tuwesa ng'ogha kungingama uchakaka, ila kuutangasa uchakaka. <verse eid="2CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 13:9" />Tunguhekelela lipindi lolosi patuwela ng'ogha na makakala, ila mwenga mkiwela na makakala, na twenga tunguwayupila ili myendeleli kughola maha nesu. <verse eid="2CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 13:10" />Hinu ninguyandika lihamba hali lipindi nikiva kutali na mwenga, ili panihika kwa mwenga nikotoho kulasimika kuwela mkalipa kwa mwenga. Na Hata nikatumila uwesa anipeghili Bambu kuwanyokola, kwaikiva Bambu kanipegha uwesa wa kuwachenga na ng'ogha kuwabomola. <verse eid="2CO 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 13:11" />Hinu walongo wa nenga, mhekeleli, muweli wachakaka, mpeghani moyu, muweli na umonga, mlikali kwa kuponga. Na hayu Sapanga mweni upalo na awapeghi ngalilu gha kuponga na aweli pamonga na mwenga. <verse eid="2CO 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 13:12" />Mjambusani kwa upalo wa Kilisito. <verse eid="2CO 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 13:13" />Wandu wogha wa Sapanga kunu wanguwajambusa. <verse eid="2CO 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 13:14" />Ninguyupa yiwa Bambu wa twenga Yesu Kilisito aweli maha kwa mwenga wogha. Ninguyupa yiwa mapalo gha Sapanga yaweli na mwenga wogha. Ninguyupa Mpumulo wa Sapanga awatangi kuutumikila wa mwenga. Sapanga mweni upalo, na umaha wa Bambu Yesu Kilisito, na Mpumulo wa Sapanga mweni kughola mahengu pamonga na twenga, alikali pamonga na mwenga wogha.<verse eid="2CO 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 13" />
</usx>